{
  "mn38:0.1": "Majjhima Nikāya 38 ",
  "mn38:0.2": "Mahātaṇhāsaṅkhayasutta ",
  "mn38:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "mn38:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā sāvatthiyaṁ viharati jetavane anāthapiṇḍikassa ārāme. ",
  "mn38:2.1": "Tena kho pana samayena sātissa nāma bhikkhuno kevaṭṭaputtassa evarūpaṁ pāpakaṁ diṭṭhigataṁ uppannaṁ hoti: ",
  "mn38:2.2": "“tathāhaṁ bhagavatā dhammaṁ desitaṁ ājānāmi yathā tadevidaṁ viññāṇaṁ sandhāvati saṁsarati anaññan”ti. ",
  "mn38:3.1": "Assosuṁ kho sambahulā bhikkhū: ",
  "mn38:3.2": "“sātissa kira nāma bhikkhuno kevaṭṭaputtassa evarūpaṁ pāpakaṁ diṭṭhigataṁ uppannaṁ: ",
  "mn38:3.3": "‘tathāhaṁ bhagavatā dhammaṁ desitaṁ ājānāmi yathā tadevidaṁ viññāṇaṁ sandhāvati saṁsarati, anaññan’”ti. ",
  "mn38:3.4": "Atha kho te bhikkhū yena sāti bhikkhu kevaṭṭaputto tenupasaṅkamiṁsu; upasaṅkamitvā sātiṁ bhikkhuṁ kevaṭṭaputtaṁ etadavocuṁ: ",
  "mn38:3.5": "“saccaṁ kira te, āvuso sāti, evarūpaṁ pāpakaṁ diṭṭhigataṁ uppannaṁ: ",
  "mn38:3.6": "‘tathāhaṁ bhagavatā dhammaṁ desitaṁ ājānāmi yathā tadevidaṁ viññāṇaṁ sandhāvati saṁsarati, anaññan’”ti? ",
  "mn38:3.7": "“Evaṁ byā kho ahaṁ, āvuso, bhagavatā dhammaṁ desitaṁ ājānāmi yathā tadevidaṁ viññāṇaṁ sandhāvati saṁsarati, anaññan”ti. ",
  "mn38:3.8": "Atha kho te bhikkhū sātiṁ bhikkhuṁ kevaṭṭaputtaṁ eta